WEBVTT

00:00:01.113 --> 00:00:05.981
<v><b>Detective:</b></v> Interview with Kevin Smith at eight p.m. on Tuesday fourteenth of November

00:00:07.476 --> 00:00:08.726
Are you Kevin Smith?

00:00:09.356 --> 00:00:10.324
<v><b>Kevin:</b></v> Yes, I am.

00:00:11.056 --> 00:00:12.263
<v><b>Detective:</b></v> What do you do, Kevin?

00:00:13.009 --> 00:00:14.297
<v><b>Kevin:</b></v> I’m a taxi driver.

00:00:14.538 --> 00:00:15.989
<v><b>Detective:</b></v> And where do you live?

00:00:16.468 --> 00:00:19.514
<v><b>Kevin:</b></v> At fourteen Market Street.

00:00:20.068 --> 00:00:22.734
<v><b>Detective:</b></v> Do you know the suspect, Jason Brown?

00:00:23.215 --> 00:00:27.822
<v><b>Kevin:</b></v> Yes, I know him. He’s my friend. We were at school together.

00:00:28.436 --> 00:00:31.508
<v><b>Detective:</b></v> Where were you yesterday afternoon at five o’clock?

00:00:32.188 --> 00:00:40.508
<v><b>Kevin:</b></v> Yesterday at five o’clock… I was in my taxi. I was in my taxi all afternoon.

00:00:40.755 --> 00:00:43.708
<v><b>Detective:</b></v> And at seven o’clock? Where were you then?

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:46.917
<v><b>Kevin:</b></v> I was in a pub. The Black Horse.

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:48.628
<v><b>Detective:</b></v> Where is it exactly?

00:00:49.074 --> 00:00:52.060
<v><b>Kevin:</b></v> In South Street. Near the station.

00:00:52.785 --> 00:00:53.786
<v><b>Detective:</b></v> Were you alone?

00:00:54.139 --> 00:00:57.023
<v><b>Kevin:</b></v> No, I was with Jason.

00:00:57.743 --> 00:00:59.718
<v><b>Detective:</b></v> Were you only with Jason?

00:01:00.645 --> 00:01:04.563
<v><b>Kevin:</b></v> Er, no. My wife was there. And Jason’s wife.

00:01:05.063 --> 00:01:09.104
<v><b>Detective:</b></v> Jason’s wife? She was with you?

00:01:09.815 --> 00:01:11.450
<v><b>Kevin:</b></v> Er, yes.

00:01:11.451 --> 00:01:12.099
<v><b>Detective:</b></v> Are you sure?

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:15.704
<v><b>Kevin:</b></v> Yes… no… I can’t remember.

00:01:15.705 --> 00:01:19.376
<v><b>Detective:</b></v> You can’t remember who you were with yesterday? Very interesting…